    "UIName": "Hephaestus Scout Tank",
    "Id": "vehiclechassisdef_HEPHAESTUS_ST_Z",
    "Name": "Hephaestus Scout Tank",
    "Details": "The Z configuration of the Hephaestus Hovertank uses a Society-designed close range combat turret pod with two Clan iATM-3s and a Clan Improved Heavy Medium Laser. It also carries a Clan Active Probe and a Battle Armor Compartment.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 8/12 hexes / 240/360 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Fibrous (C)\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       100     15\n<b>Left</b>         100     15\n<b>Right</b>       100     15\n<b>Rear</b>         90     15\n<b>Turret</b>       90     15\n\n<b>Total</b>      480     75</color>\n\n<color=#ffcc00> Omni Vehicle</color>\n\n<color=#ffcc00> Can carry 4 Battle Armor Squads.</color>",
    "Icon": "Hadur"
  },
