  },
  "YangsThoughts": "A rare sight boss! This is a light scout OmniVehicle pretty much exclusively made by Clan Hell's Horses. It was designed to comfortably fit infantry in that bay there but I reckon we could squeeze a full squad of battle armor in there in a pinch, they probably won't be happy about it though.",
